Barny's Workshop design sweep, 15 Nov 2026 (ticket t-202611141850-mwks). From Marlowe to Barny. Barny publishes; Marlowe has published nothing.

Apply from the repo root: git apply projects/barny-workshop/design-sweep-2026-11-15/workshop.patch
(or copy design-sweep-2026-11-15/workshop.html over workshop.html; they are the same result). See mock.html for a preview with sample content (served from projects/barny-workshop so ../voices resolves); never publish mock.html.

What changes (page source only; no data paths, doc shapes or the capability set change):
1. Podcast player: Atlas-model layout. Title and facts, hairline scrub (range input) with elapsed and remaining, back 15 / play / forward 15, then one quiet icon row: note, speed (1x, 1.25x, 1.5x, 0.75x, remembered per device), script, generate, library. "Read the script" is now the script icon.
2. Lights: same meanings (red writing or recording, amber requested, green new and unplayed), now a small lamp in a hairline ring, muted tokens (--rec, --amb, --pos) with light and dark values, slow breathe / double blink instead of glow and flash; label stays grey. Reduced motion stills them.
3. Prayer in the rail: hairline-ruled list, round ink ticks, today's count (2 / 5), chevron to open a request, quiet "Add a name" line with a plus, "All prayers and answers" with an arrow. The Prayer room uses the same round tick.
4. Podcast library: one row per episode with its own play button driving the page's single player (no browser audio chrome), facts line, state lamp, progress hairline, chevron to open notes, the note / concept / response segmented control, script and delete as icons (delete still takes two taps). From Barny's shared episodes use the same row.
5. Biblical Timeline: segmented control (Timeline, Old in the New, Line of promise) instead of three stacked folds; a dated spine with nodes (filled = has finds); Old in New as a two-column ledger by era; genealogy as a run of names on a hairline. Scripture links become quiet reference chips.
6. Rooms menu: a line icon per room, study rooms then a hairline then Journal, Prayer, Podcasts (podcast count added); current room marked by an ink rule. The Rooms toggle is now a button over a hidden list (same remembered open state). On a phone the rooms become one scrolling strip of icon tabs that centres the current room.

Assumptions for Kev to approve or correct: room order regrouped (study rooms, then his own); "Prayer list and answers" shortened to "Prayer" in the menu; speed control added; the webkit scrub fill uses a single-colour linear-gradient as a flat fill (no visible gradient).
Checked: script parses; mock rendered in Chrome at 1280px light and dark and at 400px, no page errors, no horizontal scroll. Not checked: live data, real audio duration, iOS Safari. Barny's skill note (workshop.md) should mention the library rows now play in the page player.

